{"seq":2,"slug":"vi-applications","title":"应用：VAE、主题模型与归一化流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/variational-inference/practice/vi-applications","wordCount":1537,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"应用-vae-主题模型与归一化流\">应用：VAE、主题模型与归一化流</h1><p>变分推断真正的说服力不在公式，而在它撑起了几个改变领域的模型。变分自编码器（VAE）把 VI 装进神经网络、开创了摊销推断；隐狄利克雷分配（LDA）是 VI 在大规模主题建模上的经典胜利；归一化流则回答了「变分族表达力不够」这个贯穿全 hub 的痛点。这一篇把三者串起来看 VI 如何在实战中发力，每个都指回前面章节的原理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-摊销推断-vae-的核心创新\">核心概念：摊销推断——VAE 的核心创新</h2><p>标准 <a href=\"../foundations/vi-model\">变分框架</a> 有个笨重之处：为每个数据点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 都要单独优化一套变分参数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。数据一多，要优化的参数量随之爆炸，新数据来了还得从头优化。VAE 的破局招是<strong>摊销推断</strong>（amortized inference）：不为每个点单独优化，而是训练一个共享的<strong>推断网络</strong>（编码器）<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_\\phi(z\\mid x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϕ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，输入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 直接吐出变分参数——把「逐点优化」摊销成「一次学一个函数」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;输入 x&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;编码器 q_φ(z|x)&lt;br/&gt;推断网络·输出 μ,σ&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;重参数化采样&lt;br/&gt;z = μ + σ⊙ε, ε~N(0,1)&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;解码器 p_θ(x|z)&lt;br/&gt;生成网络·重构 x&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[重构损失&lt;br/&gt;E_q[log p(x|z)]&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; F[&quot;KL 正则&lt;br/&gt;KL(q(z|x)‖p(z))&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; G[&quot;最大化 ELBO&lt;br/&gt;= 重构 − KL&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H[&quot;反向传播·端到端训练&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"输入 x\"] --&gt; B[\"编码器 q_φ(z|x)&lt;br/&gt;推断网络·输出 μ,σ\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"重参数化采样&lt;br/&gt;z = μ + σ⊙ε, ε~N(0,1)\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"解码器 p_θ(x|z)&lt;br/&gt;生成网络·重构 x\"]\n    D --&gt; E[重构损失&lt;br/&gt;E_q[log p(x|z)]\"]\n    B --&gt; F[\"KL 正则&lt;br/&gt;KL(q(z|x)‖p(z))\"]\n    E --&gt; G[\"最大化 ELBO&lt;br/&gt;= 重构 − KL\"]\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H[\"反向传播·端到端训练\"]</pre><p>整套 VAE 就是把 <a href=\"../elbo/elbo-decomposition\">ELBO 分解</a> 里「重构项减 KL 正则项」当损失，编码器出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu,\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span>，靠 <a href=\"reparameterization\">重参数化技巧</a> 让梯度穿过采样，编码器解码器一起端到端训练。三个前面章节的原理在这里合流：ELBO 是目标、重参数化是手段、摊销是工程创新。训练完，解码器 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_\\theta(x\\mid z)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 单独拿出来就是个生成模型，从先验采 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 即可生成新样本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"vae-的取舍与后验坍缩\">VAE 的取舍与后验坍缩</h2><p>VAE 好用，但带着 VI 的全部性格。它的编码器默认输出对角高斯，即一个 <a href=\"../algorithms/mean-field\">平均场</a> 近似，所以隐空间的后验相关被抹掉、方差被低估；它优化反向 KL，所以生成样本常偏「模糊」而非「多样」。最著名的失败模式是 <a href=\"../elbo/elbo-decomposition\">ELBO 分解</a> 讲过的<strong>后验坍缩</strong>：解码器太强时 KL 项塌到零、隐变量被忽略。缓解手段（KL 退火、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span>-VAE 加权、削弱解码器）都能从 ELBO 的两项结构推出来。理解 VAE 的边界，本质就是理解 VI 的边界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"lda-主题模型-vi-的规模化胜利\">LDA 主题模型：VI 的规模化胜利</h2><p>在深度学习之前，VI 最耀眼的战绩是主题模型。隐狄利克雷分配（LDA）把每篇文档建模成若干「主题」的混合，每个主题是词表上的一个分布。隐变量有三层：每篇文档的主题比例、每个词的主题归属、各主题的词分布。语料动辄百万文档，MCMC 慢到不实用。</p>\n<p>VI 在这里恰好合适：LDA 是条件共轭的指数族模型，<a href=\"../algorithms/cavi\">坐标上升 CAVI</a> 的更新有闭式；而 Hoffman 等人 2013 年提出的 <a href=\"../algorithms/stochastic-vi\">随机变分推断 SVI</a> 更进一步，用数据子采样 + 自然梯度让 LDA 能在线处理无限流入的文档——每次只看一小批文档就更新一次主题信念。这套「共轭 + CAVI/SVI」的组合，是 VI 规模化能力的教科书示范，也解释了为什么 VI 一度几乎等同于「大规模主题模型的推断方法」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"归一化流-突破变分族的表达力天花板\">归一化流：突破变分族的表达力天花板</h2><p>前面反复出现一个痛点：平均场/对角高斯太简单，逼不近复杂后验。归一化流（normalizing flow）从根上解决它——用一串<strong>可逆且可微</strong>的变换 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>K</mi></msub><mo>∘</mo><mo>⋯</mo><mo>∘</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=T_K\\circ\\cdots\\circ T_1(z_0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∘</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">⋯</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∘</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 把一个简单基分布（如标准高斯）逐步扭成任意复杂的形状，同时用变量替换公式精确追踪密度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>K</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>K</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>K</mi></munderover><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><mi>det</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><msub><mi>z</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log q_K(z_K)=\\log q_0(z_0)-\\sum_{k=1}^{K}\\log\\left|\\det\\frac{\\partial T_k}{\\partial z_{k-1}}\\right|.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1304em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:2.4em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"2.4em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 2400\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v1200 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v-1200 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v1200 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mop\">det</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8943em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:2.4em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"2.4em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 2400\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v1200 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v-1200 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v1200 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">.</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>只要每个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的雅可比行列式好算，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>K</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的密度就可精确计算，直接当变分族丢进 ELBO 优化。这让变分近似能捕捉多峰、非线性相关、重尾——把 <a href=\"../elbo/kl-divergence\">KL 散度与方向</a> 里的缩方差问题大幅缓解。据 2025-2026 的研究进展，归一化流被广泛用于黑盒 VI 定义灵活后验，并与路径梯度估计器结合以进一步降方差；也有工作用 VI-流构造传输映射为 MCMC/RJMCMC 提速，报告在每 CPU 秒有效样本量上取得 2–5 倍加速（arXiv 2506.02162）。归一化流本身作为生成模型的完整机理，属兄弟 hub 的范畴，本篇只讲它作为变分族的用法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三大应用横向对照\">三大应用横向对照</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>应用</th>\n<th>隐变量结构</th>\n<th>变分族</th>\n<th>关键算法</th>\n<th>VI 解决的痛点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>VAE</td>\n<td>连续、逐样本</td>\n<td>摊销对角高斯</td>\n<td>重参数化 + SGD</td>\n<td>逐点优化太贵 → 摊销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LDA 主题模型</td>\n<td>离散+连续、共轭</td>\n<td>平均场</td>\n<td>CAVI / SVI</td>\n<td>语料太大 → 子采样</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>归一化流 VI</td>\n<td>连续、灵活</td>\n<td>可逆变换叠加</td>\n<td>重参数化 + 流</td>\n<td>族表达力不足 → 更宽的族</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三者恰好对应 VI 的三条工程主线：摊销（省参数）、子采样（扩数据）、更宽的族（提精度）。把它们放在一起，正好复盘了整个 hub 的知识网。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>摊销推断是 VAE 的核心创新：用共享编码器 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_\\phi(z\\mid x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϕ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 一次学一个函数，替代逐点优化变分参数。</li>\n<li>VAE 把「重构 − KL 正则」当损失，编码器出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu,\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span>、重参数化让梯度穿过采样、端到端训练；解码器即生成模型。</li>\n<li>VAE 继承 VI 全部性格：平均场低估相关、反向 KL 致样本模糊、强解码器致后验坍缩，缓解手段皆源于 ELBO 结构。</li>\n<li>LDA 是 VI 规模化的经典胜利：条件共轭下 CAVI 闭式更新，SVI 用子采样 + 自然梯度支持在线百万文档。</li>\n<li>归一化流用可逆可微变换把简单基分布扭成复杂后验，精确追踪密度，突破平均场表达力天花板、缓解缩方差。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>摊销所依赖的低方差梯度：<a href=\"reparameterization\">重参数化技巧</a></li>\n<li>落地时的工具、诊断与坑：<a href=\"vi-in-practice\">落地与边界</a></li>\n<li>LDA 背后的闭式算法：<a href=\"../algorithms/cavi\">坐标上升 (CAVI)</a></li>\n<li>跨库·概率编程如何一键搭 VAE/LDA 并做 SVI：<a href=\"../../bayesian-data-analysis/computation/probabilistic-programming\">贝叶斯数据分析 · 概率编程</a></li>\n<li>跨库·高斯过程用变分诱导点做可扩展近似：<a href=\"../../gaussian-processes/practice/scalable-gps\">高斯过程 · 可扩展 GP</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"应用：VAE、主题模型与归一化流","id":"应用-vae-主题模型与归一化流"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：摊销推断——VAE 的核心创新","id":"核心概念-摊销推断-vae-的核心创新"},{"level":2,"text":"VAE 的取舍与后验坍缩","id":"vae-的取舍与后验坍缩"},{"level":2,"text":"LDA 主题模型：VI 的规模化胜利","id":"lda-主题模型-vi-的规模化胜利"},{"level":2,"text":"归一化流：突破变分族的表达力天花板","id":"归一化流-突破变分族的表达力天花板"},{"level":2,"text":"三大应用横向对照","id":"三大应用横向对照"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"重参数化技巧：让梯度穿过一次随机采样","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/variational-inference/practice/reparameterization"},"next":{"title":"落地与边界：工具、诊断与何时别用 VI","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/variational-inference/practice/vi-in-practice"}}